  "description": "E203: compare static/runtime-coordinate independent halo at 16x16 and 64x64 in ABBAAB order; scale runtime coordinates through 512x512 with fixed 32 cells and 64 epochs per PE. Every run captures and audits every PE before advancing. Three separate one-launch runtimes per shape; retain compile/load and same-PE intervals separately. Static64 control follows the scaling ladder. Compile bounds use local runtime scaling and E194 static64 1081s; worker600s allows E194 load254s plus capture, without treating timeout as remote termination.",
